       fhir:short [ fhir:v "R5: The publisher of the citation record, not the publisher of the article or artifact being cited (new)" ] ;
       fhir:definition [ fhir:v "R5: `Citation.publisher` (new:string)" ] ;
       fhir:comment [ fhir:v "Element `Citation.publisher` is not mapped to FHIR R4, since FHIR R5 `Citation` is not mapped.\nElement `Citation.publisher` has no mapping targets in FHIR R4. Typically, this is because the element has been added (is a new element).\nUsually an organization but may be an individual. The publisher (or steward) of the citation record is the organization or individual primarily responsible for the maintenance and upkeep of the citation record. This is not necessarily the same individual or organization that developed and initially authored the content. The publisher is the primary point of contact for questions or issues with the citation record. This item SHOULD be populated unless the information is available from context." ] ;
