       fhir:comment [ fhir:v "Element `Citation.description` is not mapped to FHIR R4, since FHIR R5 `Citation` is not mapped.\nElement `Citation.description` has no mapping targets in FHIR R4. Typically, this is because the element has been added (is a new element).\nThis description can be used to capture details such as comments about misuse, instructions for clinical use and interpretation, literature references, examples from the paper world, etc. It is not a rendering of the citation as conveyed in the 'text' field of the resource itself. This item SHOULD be populated unless the information is available from context (e.g. the language of the citation is presumed to be the predominant language in the place the citation was created)." ] ;
