       fhir:comment [ fhir:v "Element `Citation.purpose` is not mapped to FHIR R4, since FHIR R5 `Citation` is not mapped.\nElement `Citation.purpose` has no mapping targets in FHIR R4. Typically, this is because the element has been added (is a new element).\nThis element does not describe the usage of the citation. Instead, it provides traceability of ''why'' the resource is either needed or ''why'' it is defined as it is.  This may be used to point to source materials or specifications that drove the structure of this citation." ] ;
